{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"れっすん。\n乃木めんはレッスンの始めと最後に必ず乃木坂コールするんですよー\n努力!感謝!笑顔!うちらは乃木坂上り坂!46!いえーい!\n...。\nこのフレーズを文面化すると「!」が多いことに気づいたよひめたん(・o・ノ)ノ\nそれだけ勢いがあるってことぢゃね。ふふふ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん筋トレ苦手ぢゃー('・ω・`)\nでも充実しとった。真冬に半袖でいい汗かきました!\n明日筋肉痛決まりぢゃね。あーいたたたた(>_<)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そいえばままからのメールによると、地元のとあるＣＤショップに\nもう乃木坂46のポップがあったらしいー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/01/04/himeka0042.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわーうわうわうわ。こりゃびっくりするしか!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右横にスペースも空けてある！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"携帯に貼ってあるシールは何かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「もう我慢できません-I cannot endure It anymore-」\nわんちゃんがごはんを我慢してるイラストつきω\nぴったりぢゃーんって思ったから(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの部屋はどんな感じなのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー\n家具は赤と白でまとめてる!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真いつ撮ったの？ホテルで撮っているようにも見えるのだが…。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴんぽーん(∀)!\n乃木坂の初期の初期!\nひめたん最近前髪分けとるんぢゃけど、\nぱっつんと分けとるのみなさんはどっちが好きですかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは乃木坂のテストで１番成績よかったので、勉強法とか聞きたいです\n全国の乃木坂応援してる受験生に、ひめたんから応援メッセージくださーい＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいー。\nお勉強法かぁ。暗記系の科目だったら、オレンジのペンとかでノートまとめをして\n赤下敷きで隠す!スライドして覚える!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノートまとめで覚えて、さらに復習して頭にたたきこむ(`・・')\n受験生のみなさーんひめたんと一緒にステキな春を迎えましよーう♪\n体調崩したら遅れをとっちゃうから、無理はせんでね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年のひめたんの目標は何ですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46としての活動が充実できるよう頑張る!\nステキな女子高生になる(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログのコメントがたくさん増えても、ある程度はファンとの交流を計ってくれるかなー？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっちろん(ω)♪\nだからみなさんこれからも遊びに来てくださいよー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日芽香さんってボケとツッコミどっちですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大抵ぼけ(ω)\nでもひめたん以上にボケる人といるとツッコミにかわります♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんお正月は着物着たりするの？（今年は東京だからないかな？）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島におっても着物は着んかなー。\n去年の夏祭りの時は着ましたきました(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーと初詣に行くのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー未定('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元に帰ってから初詣いきたいんぢゃけど、まだやっとるかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その頃には終わっとる気がする...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おみくじ何でしたか？ひめたん萌吉とか出そうやし(^_^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"も、も、もえきちー!!!\n(*/ω＼*)\n萌吉のおみくじ引きたいっ!\nでもひめたん実際、去年末吉引いたんよ...。\nぢゃけ怖くて引けない('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃおす∩^ω^∩★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/01/04/himeka0044.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんひめたんらりん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}